---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About VizAI | Honest AI Visibility Management"
  description="VizAI helps businesses ensure AI gets their story right. Transparent pricing, honest methodology, clear limitations."
  canonicalPath="/about"
  ogTitle="About VizAI | Honest AI Visibility Management"
  ogDescription="Transparent AI visibility analysis and management. No over-promises, just clear methodology."
  twitterTitle="About VizAI"
  twitterDescription="Honest AI visibility management with transparent pricing and clear limitations."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="section-dark">
    <div class="container narrow center">
      <div class="pill">About VizAI</div>
      <h1 class="section-title" style="margin-top: 12px;">
        Making sure AI gets your story right
      </h1>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        40% of your prospects ask ChatGPT or Claude about companies before visiting websites.
        If AI gets your story wrong, you lose deals you never knew existed.
        We help you fix that — transparently, methodically, without over-promising.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Approach -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2 class="section-title center">Our Methodology</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle center">
        We test how AI systems actually describe your business, then help you correct the record with structured, authoritative data.
      </p>

      <div class="why-grid" style="margin-top: 32px;">
        <div class="why-card">
          <h3>1. Test Real AI Systems</h3>
          <p>We query ChatGPT, Claude, and Perplexity with real questions your prospects might ask. This isn't speculation — it's direct observation of what AI says about you today.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <h3>2. Score Three Dimensions</h3>
          <p><strong>Discovery:</strong> Can AI find you?<br><strong>Accuracy:</strong> Does it describe you correctly?<br><strong>Authority:</strong> Does it cite you directly or rely on directories?</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <h3>3. Build Canonical Truth</h3>
          <p>We help you create a structured "truth file" — your official business profile in a format AI systems can reliably reference.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <h3>4. Deploy Structured Signals</h3>
          <p>Schema markup, authoritative profiles, and API-accessible data give AI systems clear, trustworthy sources to cite instead of guessing or relying on outdated info.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <h3>5. Monitor & Correct</h3>
          <p>AI training data evolves. What's accurate today can drift tomorrow. Ongoing monitoring catches issues before they cost you pipeline.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <h3>6. No Magic Promises</h3>
          <p>We can't guarantee Wikipedia placement. We can't force AI to cite you. We <em>can</em> give AI better data and track how its descriptions improve over time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What We Do vs Don't Do -->
  <section class="section-contrast">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2 class="section-title center">What We Do (and Don't Do)</h2>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; margin-top: 32px; max-width: 700px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
        <div style="background: var(--bg-subtle); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px;">
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #2e7d32;">✓ What We Do</h3>
          <ul class="who-list">
            <li>Test how AI currently describes your business</li>
            <li>Score Discovery, Accuracy, and Authority</li>
            <li>Build structured canonical profiles</li>
            <li>Deploy schema markup and authoritative data sources</li>
            <li>Monitor AI responses over time</li>
            <li>Submit corrections when AI gets facts wrong</li>
            <li>Provide transparent recommendations for improvement</li>
            <li>Show you exactly what questions we asked and what AI answered</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div style="background: var(--bg-subtle); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px;">
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #c62828;">✗ What We Don't Do</h3>
          <ul class="who-list" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
            <li>Guarantee Wikipedia placement or editing success</li>
            <li>Promise immediate ranking changes</li>
            <li>Claim we can "control" what AI says about you</li>
            <li>Sell SEO services (this is AI visibility, not search ranking)</li>
            <li>Make up scores or use vague "confidence metrics"</li>
            <li>Hide our methodology or process</li>
            <li>Claim comprehensive audits for free automated scans</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="section-subtitle center" style="margin-top: 24px; max-width: 650px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
        Our approach is methodical, transparent, and realistic. We start where you are,
        show you what's working and what isn't, and give you options to fix it — no hype, no guarantees we can't keep.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Service Tiers Overview -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2 class="section-title center">How We Work With You</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle center">We meet you where you are with a clear upgrade path from free to fully managed.</p>

      <div class="steps-grid" style="margin-top: 32px;">
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-number">Free</div>
          <h3>See the Problem</h3>
          <p>Automated scan gives directional scores. Helps you understand IF issues exist. No human review, no detailed analysis.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-number">$495</div>
          <h3>Understand It</h3>
          <p>Human-reviewed snapshot across ChatGPT, Claude, and Perplexity. Shows you WHAT the problem is and where AI gets confused.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-number">$1,950+</div>
          <h3>Fix & Monitor</h3>
          <p>Build canonical truth, deploy schema, track changes over time. Foundation for ongoing visibility management.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-number">Custom</div>
          <h3>Govern Actively</h3>
          <p>We handle corrections, placements, monitoring, and executive reporting. Fully managed AI visibility governance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="center" style="margin-top: 32px;">
        <a href="/packages" class="btn-primary">
          <span>View Detailed Pricing</span>
          <span class="icon">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why This Matters -->
  <section class="section-contrast">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2 class="section-title center">Why AI Visibility Matters</h2>

      <div class="why-grid" style="margin-top: 24px;">
        <div class="why-card">
          <h3>Discovery Gap</h3>
          <p>If AI can't find you or confuses you with competitors, prospects never learn about you. You're invisible in the new discovery layer.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <h3>Accuracy Risk</h3>
          <p>Outdated locations, wrong services, confused specialties — any inaccuracy costs you trust before prospects even contact you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <h3>Authority Loss</h3>
          <p>When AI cites directories instead of your official site, you lose control of your narrative and rely on third parties to get it right.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <h3>Drift Over Time</h3>
          <p>AI training data evolves. What's accurate today can become wrong tomorrow as models retrain. Monitoring prevents silent pipeline loss.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="section-subtitle center" style="margin-top: 32px; max-width: 650px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
        Every prospect who asks AI about you before visiting your site is making a decision based on what AI says.
        If AI gets it wrong, you never get the chance to correct them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow center">
      <h2 class="section-title">Start with a free scan</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        See how AI currently describes your business. Get directional scores in under 60 seconds.
        No commitment, no credit card required.
      </p>

      <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; margin-top: 24px;">
        <a href="/scan" class="btn-primary">
          <span>Run Free Scan</span>
          <span class="icon">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/packages" class="btn-secondary">
          <span>View All Packages</span>
          <span class="icon">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="micro" style="margin-top: 16px; color: var(--text-muted);">
        Free scan is automated and directional. Comprehensive human-reviewed analysis starts at $495 CAD.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
